Includes all changes and bugfixes from the latest upstream NTMain update - [X5758 - slime time, time for slime](https://github.com/HbmMods/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/releases/tag/1.0.27_X5758)

## Changes
# Added
Cobaltite, which is now the main method of getting cobalt replacing ow cobalt and nether cobalt
Mining it with silk touch gives the block, without gives 4-6 fragments
Processed in crucible it yields 1 ingot of cobalt
Flaming Anthracite, replaces flaming coal ore and acts as a more efficient version of base anthracite coal
Can be crushed into chunks, processing further will yield coal  or coal dust
Recipes for Mass glass production in crucible
New netherglyphid blocks for future nether glyphid biome
New cyst block that vomits blood with new TE class under .deco pkg
Oredicts for all crystal items
Crystal blocks which are to be used in a future geode structure or meteorite/spires of red phosphorus crystals to replace the old red phosphorus ore
Also act as storage blocks
Big WorldManager, ChunkManager files for new nether biome work
Added new FleshPlant class extending blockenummulti for future glyphid biome
Infrastructure for the new symbol system
Symbols are permanent buffs/debuffs with unique effects for each symbol, behaviors in the shared SymbolBehavior class, with a typed system such that you can have specific effects for specific symbols n shit
Also a new interface to provide getters and setters for symbols
Each symbol has a set of hardcoded behaviors in it in SymbolBehavior
Future, you'll be able to find them in nether loot
They are themed around religion
1 new Symbol, Guilt
New [Drug] and [Consumable] Fluid Traits
[Drug] Is used for new syringes, which replace the old consumables
New Effects: Roid Rage, Med-X, and Stimulated
[Consumable] Is for new Auto-Drip armor mod, which slowly dripfeeds you a fluid.
Bloatsprout tree
Automatable in buzzsaw
Nether air being harmful, you now need a mask to travel in it.
New supersecreteffects class allowing you to apply supersecreteffect shaders DIRECTLY from main mc resource location
This is used in a new renderer for psycho/roid rage which uses the new phosphor renderer now
All new flesh plants, their sounds, and textures
New base for future nether biomes (NetherBiomeBase) to be extended and filled out when making a new nether biome


# Changed
Removed cobalt ore (kept block)
Removed flaming coal ore (kept block)
Moved rutile to nether
Changes to the ritual class and ritual output type, so it detects
    ItemSymbol.SymbolType type = ((ItemSymbol) center.item.getItem()).getSymbolType(center.item);
And if symbol, assigns that symbol's metadata as a player prop enum that corresponds to the metadata from that symbol.
Major changes to ChunkProviderHbmHell, which results in the chunk provider actually working and having like 10 times better generation, I copied from EFR most of it
Also for some reason the toplayer of the hell biome kept on corrupting to grass so i had to add like a hard guard for that, might be removed in future
